  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Ram 2500/3500 Crew Cab\nwith 1st Row Bucker or Bench Seats\nOnly fit 8 Passenger & Carpet Flooring\nFeatures\nEnhanced Coverage, Comprehensive Defense- Introducing our newly upgraded Ram 2500/3500 Crew Cab 2026-2019 floor mats, meticulously engineered to offer unparalleled coverage for your vehicle's interior. From door sills to seats and pedals, our product ensures a pristine and well-maintained environment for all your journeys\nPremium Material - TPE, Certified Quality: YITAMOTOR Ram 2500/3500 floor mats, crafted from superior TPE, are durable, wear-resistant, and eco-friendly. They've earned SGS, IATF, and EHS certifications, proving their high quality and safety. Trust in our globally recognized excellence\nAnti-Slip Safety, Cutting- Edge 3D Scanning Technology: Our Ram 2500/3500 Crew Cab 2026 floor mats are designed with anti-slip features, significantly enhancing your driving safety by preventing unexpected slippage. Leveraging advanced 3D scanning technology, they are tailored for a flawless fit in your vehicle, offering more than just protection\nAll-Climate Adaptability, Uncompromised Performance- Come rain or shine, Ram 2500/3500 Floor Liners are your reliable companion. They deliver unwavering protection across seasons, ensuring your comfort in every drive\nEffortless Clean-Up, Simplified Maintenance- We've designed our floor mats with an emphasis on ease of cleaning. Dust, mud, or accidental spills? No issues. Simply clean them up with minimal effort and focus more on the joy of driving",
